# MANUAL BLOCKLIST -- permanent by default, or an absolute UTC expiry.
#   <IP|CIDR> [all|PORTS] [until=YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ]
# Use `block IP --ports PORTS --for 6h` to calculate and save an expiry.
# Expiry is not extended by reload or reboot. All means all protected ports.
# Examples (RFC 5737 documentation ranges):
#   198.51.100.66
#   203.0.113.0/24 22001,22003
# Scoped bans work with either JAIL_PER_PORT setting; allowlist rules take priority.
